      "type": "∀ {R : Type u_1} [inst : CommRing R] [inst_1 : IsDomain R] (p : Polynomial R) {r : R},\n  IsUnit r → (p.scaleRoots r).roots = Multiset.map (fun x => r * x) p.roots"
